{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://beebeeb.io/contracts/onboarding/schema.v1.json",
  "title": "GET /api/v1/onboarding, schema major 1",
  "description": "Contract for the backend-driven onboarding document (spec docs/specs/2026-10-04-backend-driven-onboarding.md rev 3, section 5). This schema describes what the SERVER emits at schema major 1. Clients MUST NOT use it as a strict parser: they ignore unknown fields and apply the fallback rules of spec 5.8 (unknown step id, unknown step status, unknown purchase.surface, unknown account.state). Dates are RFC 3339 UTC strings (pattern-checked, no format keyword so validation needs no plugin).",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "stage",
    "steps",
    "blocking"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": 1
    },
    "generated_at": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp"
    },
    "ttl_seconds": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "client": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/client"
    },
    "stage": {
      "enum": [
        "pre_account",
        "account"
      ]
    },
    "signup": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/signup"
    },
    "policy": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/policy"
    },
    "account": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/account"
    },
    "offers": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/offers"
    },
    "purchase": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/purchase"
    },
    "steps": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/step"
      }
    },
    "blocking": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "copy": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/copy"
    },
    "fallback": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/fallback"
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "$comment": "5.2/5.3: pre_account carries signup + policy; account carries account + purchase.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "stage": {
            "const": "pre_account"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "stage"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "signup",
          "policy"
        ],
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "account"
          ]
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "required": [
          "account",
          "purchase"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "5.4 closing text / 5.3: offers is omitted entirely when purchase.cta_allowed is false, and start_trial never appears then (Apple 3.1.3(f), fail closed on money).",
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "purchase"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "purchase": {
            "properties": {
              "cta_allowed": {
                "const": false
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "cta_allowed"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "offers"
          ]
        },
        "properties": {
          "steps": {
            "items": {
              "not": {
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "const": "start_trial"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "4b.8: blocking is false for allowance, trialing_no_card, trial_ended while no required step is outstanding (a required unfinished step blocks, 5.3; accept_terms is no longer one for an existing account, task 1822); true for needs_plan (4.5 full-screen explanation).",
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "account",
          "steps"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "account": {
            "required": [
              "state"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "allowance",
                  "trialing_no_card",
                  "trial_ended"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "steps": {
            "not": {
              "contains": {
                "required": [
                  "required",
                  "status"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "required": {
                    "const": true
                  },
                  "status": {
                    "not": {
                      "const": "done"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "blocking": {
            "const": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "5.3 inverse of 4b.8 (task 1740 round 2, security review P2): a document with a required step that is not done MUST be blocking:true, in every account state. Without this a server bug or a hand-built document could carry an outstanding accept_terms (or any required step) with blocking:false and a client would let the person through.",
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "steps"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "steps": {
            "contains": {
              "required": [
                "required",
                "status"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "required": {
                  "const": true
                },
                "status": {
                  "not": {
                    "const": "done"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "blocking"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "blocking": {
            "const": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "account"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "account": {
            "required": [
              "state"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "const": "needs_plan"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "blocking": {
            "const": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "5.8 rule 3 / decision 1812 Q2 (task 1822): in the pre_account document accept_terms is a required consent (signup is where the Terms are enforced); in the account document it is advisory for an existing account and is never required, so it can never make the document blocking.",
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "stage"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "stage": {
            "const": "pre_account"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "steps": {
            "items": {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "const": "accept_terms"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id"
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "properties": {
                  "required": {
                    "const": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "properties": {
          "steps": {
            "items": {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "const": "accept_terms"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id"
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "properties": {
                  "required": {
                    "const": false
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "5.8 rule 1/4: update_required blocks everything but sign out and the store update. Codex P2: the fallback must be the store update (kind update_app); use_web/contact_support would strand the client.",
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "client"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "client": {
            "required": [
              "status"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "update_required"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "blocking": {
            "const": true
          },
          "fallback": {
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "const": "update_app"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "kind"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "fallback"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": "5.8 rule 3: an unknown step id with required:true makes an old client stop, so it needs something to show: the step fallback or the document fallback. Known ids are listed in $defs/step.",
      "if": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "fallback"
          ]
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "steps": {
            "items": {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "required": {
                    "const": true
                  },
                  "id": {
                    "not": {
                      "enum": [
                        "enter_email",
                        "verify_email_code",
                        "pilot_key",
                        "accept_terms",
                        "set_password",
                        "save_recovery_phrase",
                        "create_account",
                        "verify_email",
                        "billing_profile",
                        "choose_plan",
                        "start_trial",
                        "subscribe",
                        "done"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id",
                  "required"
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "required": [
                  "fallback"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "timestamp": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]+)?Z$"
    },
    "semver": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+$"
    },
    "url": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^https://"
    },
    "client": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "enum": [
            "ok",
            "update_recommended",
            "update_required"
          ]
        },
        "min_version": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/semver"
        },
        "recommended_version": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/semver"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "status"
      ]
    },
    "signup": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "allowed": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "mode": {
          "enum": [
            "native",
            "web_handoff",
            "web_only"
          ]
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "web_url": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/url"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "allowed",
        "mode"
      ]
    },
    "policy": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "password": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "min_length": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "breach_check": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "endpoint": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^/api/v1/[^:]*$",
                  "description": "Same-origin path template, never an absolute URL. {prefix} is the k-anonymity hash prefix."
                },
                "fail_open": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "endpoint",
                "fail_open"
              ]
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "min_length",
            "breach_check"
          ]
        },
        "recovery_phrase": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "word_count": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "verify_word_count": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "word_count",
            "verify_word_count"
          ]
        },
        "terms": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "version": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"
            },
            "url": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/url"
            },
            "privacy_url": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/url"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "version",
            "url"
          ]
        },
        "email_code": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "length": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "ttl_seconds": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "resend_after_seconds": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "ticket_ttl_seconds": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "length",
            "ttl_seconds",
            "resend_after_seconds",
            "ticket_ttl_seconds"
          ]
        },
        "pilot_key": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "required": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "required"
          ]
        },
        "promo_code": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "password",
        "recovery_phrase",
        "terms",
        "email_code",
        "pilot_key"
      ]
    },
    "capability": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "allowed": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Existing typed error code or an additive new one (plan_required, account_lapsed, trial_cancelled_read_only, email_unverified, trial_ended, ...)."
        },
        "limit_bytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "limit": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "active_links": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "allowed"
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "allowed": {
                "const": false
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "reason"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "capabilities": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Closed set per schema major (spec 5.3, 5.8 rule 11): an absent capability means not allowed, and a name outside download, upload, share, delete is rejected (a new capability needs a new schema major).",
      "properties": {
        "download": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capability"
        },
        "upload": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capability"
        },
        "share": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capability"
        },
        "delete": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capability"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "download",
        "upload",
        "share"
      ]
    },
    "storage": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "quota_bytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "used_bytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "allowance_bytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "over_allowance": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "quota_bytes",
        "used_bytes"
      ]
    },
    "trial": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "no_card",
            "mandated",
            "promo"
          ]
        },
        "started_at": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp"
        },
        "ends_at": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp"
        },
        "cap_bytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "converts_automatically": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "first_charge_at": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "started_at",
        "ends_at",
        "cap_bytes",
        "converts_automatically",
        "first_charge_at"
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "const": "no_card"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "first_charge_at": {
                "type": "null"
              },
              "converts_automatically": {
                "const": false
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "lifecycle": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "read_only_since": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "data_deletion_at": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "read_only_since",
        "data_deletion_at",
        "reason"
      ]
    },
    "account": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "state": {
          "enum": [
            "allowance",
            "needs_plan",
            "trialing_no_card",
            "trial_ended",
            "trialing",
            "trial_cancelling",
            "active",
            "past_due",
            "read_only",
            "frozen",
            "lapsed",
            "legacy_free"
          ]
        },
        "legacy_account_state": {
          "enum": [
            "ok",
            "needs_plan",
            "lapsed"
          ]
        },
        "email_verified": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "capabilities": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilities"
        },
        "storage": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/storage"
        },
        "trial": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/trial"
        },
        "lifecycle": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/lifecycle"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "state",
        "legacy_account_state",
        "email_verified",
        "capabilities",
        "storage"
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$comment": "4b.8 legacy mapping",
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "allowance",
                  "needs_plan"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "legacy_account_state": {
                "const": "needs_plan"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "const": "trialing_no_card"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "legacy_account_state": {
                "const": "ok"
              },
              "trial": {
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "no_card"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "trial"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "const": "trial_ended"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "legacy_account_state": {
                "enum": [
                  "lapsed",
                  "needs_plan"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "trial",
              "lifecycle"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "const": "trialing"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "trial": {
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "mandated"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "trial"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "allowance",
                  "trialing_no_card",
                  "trial_ended"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "storage": {
                "required": [
                  "allowance_bytes",
                  "over_allowance"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "trial_ended",
                  "lapsed",
                  "read_only"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "lifecycle"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "$comment": "email_verified:true cannot coexist with a capability denied for email_unverified (fixture consistency, Codex P2).",
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "email_verified": {
                "const": true
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "email_verified"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "capabilities": {
                "properties": {
                  "download": {
                    "properties": {
                      "reason": {
                        "not": {
                          "const": "email_unverified"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "upload": {
                    "properties": {
                      "reason": {
                        "not": {
                          "const": "email_unverified"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "share": {
                    "properties": {
                      "reason": {
                        "not": {
                          "const": "email_unverified"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "delete": {
                    "properties": {
                      "reason": {
                        "not": {
                          "const": "email_unverified"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "offers": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "trial": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "available": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "unavailable_reason": {
              "enum": [
                "already_used",
                "email_unverified",
                "temporarily_unavailable",
                "not_offered_here",
                null
              ]
            },
            "length_days": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "cap_bytes": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "start_endpoint": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^/api/v1/"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "available",
            "unavailable_reason",
            "length_days",
            "cap_bytes",
            "start_endpoint"
          ],
          "allOf": [
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "available": {
                    "const": true
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "properties": {
                  "unavailable_reason": {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                }
              },
              "else": {
                "properties": {
                  "unavailable_reason": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "coupon": {
          "$comment": "Task 1814, additive within v1 (README rule 2): present only when the client sent X-Beebeeb-Coupon, the coupon is usable and this account holds no plan. Free in slice A (price_cents 0). Never present when purchase.cta_allowed is false (offers is omitted then).",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "code_hint": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "plan": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "plan_label": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "duration_months": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "price_cents": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "redeem_endpoint": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^/api/v1/"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "code_hint",
            "plan",
            "duration_months",
            "price_cents",
            "redeem_endpoint"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "purchase": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "surface": {
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "in_page",
            "system_browser",
            "external_link"
          ]
        },
        "cta_allowed": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "price_visibility": {
          "enum": [
            "full",
            "hidden",
            "n/a"
          ]
        },
        "methods": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "checkout": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "open_with": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "return_kind": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "poll_seconds": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "copy": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "surface",
        "cta_allowed",
        "price_visibility",
        "methods"
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$comment": "5.7: surface none implies no call to action, no checkout.",
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "surface": {
                "const": "none"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "cta_allowed": {
                "const": false
              },
              "methods": {
                "maxItems": 0
              }
            },
            "not": {
              "required": [
                "checkout"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "step": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "id is an open string on purpose: clients meet step ids they do not know (5.8 rule 3). Known ids: enter_email, verify_email_code, pilot_key, accept_terms, set_password, save_recovery_phrase, create_account, verify_email, billing_profile, choose_plan, start_trial, subscribe, done.",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "status": {
          "enum": [
            "todo",
            "in_progress",
            "done",
            "blocked"
          ]
        },
        "required": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "ui": {
          "enum": [
            "action",
            "info"
          ]
        },
        "params": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "fallback": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/fallback"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "status",
        "required",
        "ui"
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$comment": "5.8 rule 3: security steps are never required:false. accept_terms is a consent step: required:true in the pre_account (signup) document, where the Terms are enforced, but ADVISORY (required:false) for an existing account in the account document (decision 1812 Q2, task 1822): see the stage rule in the top-level allOf.",
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "enum": [
                  "verify_email_code",
                  "verify_email",
                  "create_account"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "required": {
                "const": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "$comment": "4b.8: start_trial is never required and carries no_card params.",
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "const": "start_trial"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "required": {
                "const": false
              },
              "params": {
                "required": [
                  "length_days",
                  "cap_bytes",
                  "no_card"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "no_card": {
                    "const": true
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "params"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "copy": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Legal-sensitive strings rendered verbatim. Known keys: locale, region_line, trial_terms, plans_managed_on_web, trial_end_over_allowance, trial_ended_over_allowance.",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "fallback": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "update_app",
            "use_web",
            "contact_support"
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/url"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind"
      ]
    }
  }
}
